<title>UK: BZW SETS WARRANTS ON NOKIA.</title>
<headline>BZW SETS WARRANTS ON NOKIA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants said it has issued one million American-style warrants, on Nokia, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one Nokia A share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    525 FIM		   ISSUE PRICE  82.85 FIM</p>
<p> EXPIRY	    11.FEB.99		 PAYDATE	01.SEP.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  469 FIM</p>
<p> NOTES --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
